      "accessed": "2026-11-22",
      "note": "On the Wicked Blue A320: it joins JetBlue's Boston liveries, 'including ones for the Red Sox, the Celtics, the Bruins, and Dunkin' Donuts' (the Bruins jet still flying in it)."
    },
