      "accessed": "2026-11-22",
      "note": "N632JB right side taxiing at Boston, 2023-10-10, near level: flipped nose-left and fitted to shapes/A320.json (doors and fin tip; within about 11 px, 0.25 m). The gold sweep, the fin's spoked B, the titles and the centennial badge read off it."
